=== Radio Intercept Log ===
Source: Eastern European Defense Command SIGINT Station
Date: 2024-08-15
Frequency Range: 400-450 MHz (drone uplink)

--- Timeline ---

[12:00:00] DRONE-CTRL: 'Valkyrie-9, all systems nominal. Proceed with mission.'
[12:05:00] KESTREL-7: 'Copy, taking off from base Alpha. Heading north.'
[12:10:00] KESTREL-7: 'Over Zone-Alpha northern boundary. EO/IR nominal.'
[12:15:00] DRONE-CTRL: 'Copy. Switch to SIGINT mode at waypoint Bravo.'
[12:20:00] KESTREL-7: 'En route to WP-Bravo. Wind conditions light, NE 5kt.'

--- ANOMALY DETECTED ---

[12:30:00] GROUND_STATION_3: 'Wait... Valkyrie-9 is NOT at WP-Bravo?'
[12:30:15] GROUND_STATION_3: 'Telemetry shows it 380m EAST of planned waypoint.'
[12:30:30] DRONE-CTRL: 'Valkyrie-9, report your position. You missed WP-Bravo.'
