--- THE DEVIATION ---

[12:31:00] GROUND_STATION_3: 'That is NOT what the waypoint data shows!'
[12:31:15] GROUND_STATION_3: 'WP-Bravo is at 47.2591, 19.0402 — Valkyrie-9 is at ~47.2600, 19.0450'
[12:31:30] DRONE-CTRL: 'The command center says the waypoint was updated to 47.2600, 19.0450.'
[12:31:45] GROUND_STATION_3: 'Nobody authorized a waypoint update! This is a discrepancy!'
[12:32:00] DRONE-CTRL: 'Command server says mission is nominal. Must be sensor error.'

--- LATER ---

[12:45:00] KESTREL-7: 'Surveillance complete. Returning to base.'
[13:00:00] KESTREL-7: 'Landed at base Alpha. Mission nominal. All objectives met.'

--- SERVER SUMMARY ---

[13:05:00] COMMAND_SERVER: 'Mission Valkyrie-9: COMPLETE. No anomalies detected.'
[13:05:01] COMMAND_SERVER: 'All waypoints within tolerance. Status: MISSION_SUCCESS.'

--- ANALYSIS NOTE ---

The drone's flight path deviated from the approved waypoint by approximately 380m.
The command server reported the mission as successful with no anomalies.
Investigation required: discrepancy between drone telemetry and command center data.